  </figure>

  <div class="source-doc-poem">
    <p>He's no darned good, they warned my girl<br>
    he ain't got a brain in his head<br>
    but she told her Ma, "I'll give it a whirl<br>
    and change him, or fill him with lead."</p>

    <p>She is proud to announce, after forty-three years<br>
    he can fetch, he can heel and roll over<br>
    and you should see how he perks up his ears<br>
    when she whistles and orders, "Come, Rover."</p>
